        makeDay(13, "Feelings and energy", "உணர்வுகள் மற்றும் சோர்வு", "thakna, achha, bura, mood, lagna", "Catch simple feeling statements and respond with empathy.", [
            prompt("d13-1", "aaj bahut thak gayi hoon", "இன்று மிகவும் சோர்வாக இருக்கிறேன்", "I am very tired today.", "thakna", "aaj + bahut + thak gayi hoon", "bahut means very / a lot; gayi hoon can mark a state reached.", "How does the speaker feel?", ["Very tired", "Very hungry", "Very late", "Very excited"], "Very tired", .meaning, .gist),
