            prompt("d13-3", "aaj achha lag raha hai", "இன்று நன்றாக உணர்கிறேன்", "I am feeling good today.", "lagna", "aaj + achha lag raha hai", "lag raha hai is a common feeling/state frame.", "Which feeling is closest?", ["Feeling good", "Feeling lost", "Feeling sleepy", "Feeling angry"], "Feeling good", .timeClue, .gist),
