        makeDay(14, "Week 2: errands checkpoint", "இரண்டாம் வார சோதனை", "time + request + plan + feeling", "Follow a short everyday exchange that moves from a question to a plan.", [
            prompt("d14-1", "aaj office jaana hai, phir ghar aana hai", "இன்று அலுவலகம் செல்ல வேண்டும், பிறகு வீட்டிற்கு வர வேண்டும்", "I have to go to the office today, then come home.", "jaana", "aaj + place + jaana hai + phir + ghar aana hai", "Two intent frames can be chained with phir.", "What comes after the office?", ["Come home", "Go shopping", "Drink tea", "Call a friend"], "Come home", .meaning, .gist),
