            prompt("d17-1", "main kal aaungi", "நான் நாளை வருவேன்", "I will come tomorrow.", "aana", "main + kal + aaungi", "aaungi is a first-person-female future form in the come family.", "When will the speaker come?", ["Tomorrow", "Yesterday", "Now", "Later today only"], "Tomorrow", .timeClue, .verbFamilies),
