            prompt("d24-3", "main nahi aa paungi, sorry", "என்னால் வர முடியாது, மன்னிக்கவும்", "I will not be able to come, sorry.", "aana", "nahi + aa paungi", "A kind refusal can be direct and short.", "What is the answer to the invitation?", ["Cannot come", "Will come now", "Already came", "Needs food"], "Cannot come", .meaning, .gist),
