        makeDay(29, "Conversation rehearsal", "உரையாடல் பயிற்சி", "listen, repair, respond, continue", "Move from recognition to a short, useful back-and-forth.", [
            prompt("d29-1", "kahan thi? phone kyun nahi uthaya?", "எங்கே இருந்தாய்? தொலைபேசியை ஏன் எடுக்கவில்லை?", "Where were you? Why did you not answer the phone?", "lena", "past place + why + phone take", "Two questions may arrive together; catch the reason request first.", "What is the second question about?", ["The unanswered phone", "The dinner", "Tomorrow's trip", "The office"], "The unanswered phone", .meaning, .gist),
